text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Add {B}{B}{B}.', 'At end of combat, if Kjeldoran Home Guard attacked or blocked this combat, put a -0/-1 counter on Kjeldoran Home Guard and create a 0/1 white Deserter creature token.', 'Death Spark deals 1 damage to any target.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if Death Spark is in your graveyard with a creature card directly above it, you may pay {1}. If you do, return Death Spark to your hand.', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\nDrift of the Dead's power and toughness are each equal to the number of snow lands you control.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\nSacrifice Tinder Wall: Add {R}{R}.\\n{R}, Sacrifice Tinder Wall: It deals 2 damage to target creature it's blocking.", 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Draw three cards, then put two cards from your hand on top of your library in any order.', 'Enchant creature\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Binding Grasp unless you pay {1}{U}.\\nYou control enchanted creature.\\nEnchanted creature gets +0/+1.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+0 and has flying and first strike.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0.\\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, put a -0/-1 counter on that creature.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has flying.\\nEnchanted creature has first strike as long as it's blocking and you control a snow land.", 'Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.', 'Flying\\n{U}, Exile the top card of your library: Tap target creature with flying.\\n{U}, Exile the top card of your library: If the exiled card is a snow land, Storm Elemental gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Haste\\n{B}: Return Ashen Ghoul from your graveyard to the battlefield. Activate only during your upkeep and only if three or more creature cards are above Ashen Ghoul.', 'Iceberg enters the battlefield with X ice counters on it.\\n{3}: Put an ice counter on Iceberg.\\nRemove an ice counter from Iceberg: Add {C}.', "Incinerate deals 3 damage to any target. A creature dealt damage this way can't be regenerated this turn.", "Look at the top three cards of target player's library, then put them back in any order. You may have that player shuffle.\\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", "Snow swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a snow Swamp.)", "Spend only black and/or red mana on X.\\nSoul Burn deals X damage to any target. You gain life equal to the damage dealt, but not more than the amount of {B} spent on X, the player's life total before the damage was dealt, the planeswalker's loyalty before the damage was dealt, or the creature's toughness.", 'Trample\\nWhenever Aurochs attacks, it gets +1/+0 until end of turn for each other attacking Aurochs.', 'When Kjeldoran Dead enters the battlefield, sacrifice a creature.\\n{B}: Regenerate Kjeldoran Dead.', 'Woolly Mammoths has trample as long as you control a snow land.', "You may exile a green card from your hand rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nDistribute three +1/+1 counters among one, two, or three target creatures. For each +1/+1 counter you put on a creature this way, remove a +1/+1 counter from that creature at the beginning of the next cleanup step.", "You may exile a white card from your hand rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nPrevent the next 7 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn. If it's a creature, put a +0/+1 counter on it for each 1 damage prevented this way at the beginning of the next end step.", "{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Barbed Sextant: Add one mana of any color. Draw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", '{1}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Skull Catapult deals 2 damage to any target.', "{1}{R}{G}, {T}: Exile Giant Trap Door Spider and target creature without flying that's attacking you.", '{2}, {T}: Target creature with power 3 or less gains flying until end of turn.', '{2}, {T}: Target snow land is no longer snow.\\n{2}, {T}: Target nonsnow basic land becomes snow.', '{2}{R}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: Create a 3/1 black and red Graveborn creature token with haste. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.', '{2}{U}{U}: Look at the top five cards of your library, put one of them into your hand, and exile the rest.', "{R}{R}, {T}: Target creature can't be regenerated this turn.\\n{B}{B}{R}, {T}: Regenerate target black or green creature.\\n{R}{G}{G}, {T}: Regenerate target black or green creature.", '{T}, Sacrifice Gangrenous Zombies: Gangrenous Zombies deals 1 damage to each creature and each player. If you control a snow Swamp, Gangrenous Zombies deals 2 damage to each creature and each player instead.', '{T}, Sacrifice a Forest: Add three mana in any combination of {R} and/or {G}.', "{T}, Sacrifice a creature and a Swamp: Destroy target nonartifact creature. It can't be regenerated.\\n{T}, Sacrifice a creature and a snow Swamp: Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated.", '{T}: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn. When that creature leaves the battlefield this turn, sacrifice Kjeldoran Elite Guard. Activate only during combat.', '{T}: Zuran Spellcaster deals 1 damage to any target.', '{U}: Counter target spell that targets Mistfolk.']
flavor: ['"A mage must be precise as well as potent; cautious, as well as clever."\\n—Zur the Enchanter', '"Although my official log will state there is no evidence pointing to the existence of the mistfolk, my certainty is lessened by the cursed consistency of the expedition\'s eyewitness accounts."\\n—Disa the Restless, journal entry', '"For those of courage, even the sky holds no limit."\\n—Arnjlot Olasson, sky mage', '"Give me wings to fly and speed to strike. In return, the glory I earn shall be yours."\\n—Steinar Icefist, Balduvian shaman', '"How did I ever let myself get talked into this project?"\\n—Toothlicker Harj, orcish captain', '"I have seen the faces of my dead friends among that grim band, and I can bear no more."\\n—Lucilde Fiksdotter,\\nleader of the Order of the White Shield', '"I implore you not to forget the horrors of the past. You would have us start the Brothers\' War anew!"\\n—Sorine Relicbane, Soldevi heretic', '"I reeled from the blow, and then suddenly, I knew exactly what to do. Within moments, victory was mine."\\n—Gustha Ebbasdotter, Kjeldoran royal mage', '"It\'s no ornithopter, but then I\'m no Urza."\\n—Arcum Dagsson, Soldevi machinist', '"Leshrac, my liege, grant me the power I am due."\\n—Lim-Dûl, the Necromancer', '"Let any who doubt the evil of using the ancient devices look at this infernal machine. What manner of fiend would design such a sadistic device?"\\n—Sorine Relicbane, Soldevi heretic', '"Mammoths may be good to ride on, but they\'re certainly bad to fall off of!"\\n—Disa the Restless, journal entry', '"Once great literature—now great litter."\\n—Jaya Ballard, task mage', '"So large and so quiet—a combination best avoided."\\n—Disa the Restless, journal entry', '"Take their dead, and entomb them in the snow. Risen, they shall serve a new purpose."\\n—Lim-Dûl, the Necromancer', '"The so-called barbarians will not respect us for our military might—they will respect us for our honor."\\n—Lucilde Fiksdotter,\\nleader of the Order of the White Shield', '"They shall kill those whom once they loved."\\n—Lim-Dûl, the Necromancer', '"What I want, I take."\\n—Gustha Ebbasdotter, Kjeldoran royal mage', '"Will not the mountains quake and hills melt at the coming of the darkness? Share this vision with your enemies, Lim-Dûl, and they shall wither."\\n—Leshrac, Walker of Night', '"Yes, I think \'toast\' is an appropriate description."\\n—Jaya Ballard, task mage', 'Never underestimate the power of the soul unleashed.', "Not all of Terisiare's flooding was natural . . . .", 'One aurochs may feed a village, but a herd will flatten it.', 'The winged helms of the guard are put on for pageants—but taken off for war.']
artist: ['Amy Weber', 'Andi Rusu', 'Anson Maddocks', 'Brian Snõddy', 'Bryon Wackwitz', 'Christopher Rush', 'Dan Frazier', 'Douglas Shuler', 'Drew Tucker', 'Edward P. Beard, Jr.', 'Heather Hudson', 'Jeff A. Menges', 'John Matson', 'Justin Hampton', 'Kaja Foglio', 'Ken Meyer, Jr.', 'Liz Danforth', 'Mark Poole', 'Mark Tedin', 'Melissa A. Benson', 'Mike Kimble', 'Pat Lewis', 'Phil Foglio', 'Quinton Hoover', 'Richard Kane Ferguson', 'Rick Emond', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ron Spencer', 'Ruth Thompson', 'Tom Wänerstrand']
